---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact — Book Your Free CRO Audit"
  description="Book a free CRO audit or strategy call. We'll analyze your site, find what's killing your conversions, and give you a prioritized action plan — free."
  jsonLd={[contactSchema, breadcrumbSchema]}
>
  <div class="contact-page">
    <div class="contact-header">
      <div class="container ">
        <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span class="breadcrumbs__separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span class="breadcrumbs__current" aria-current="page">Contact</span>
        </nav>
        <h1 class="contact-header__title">Get Your Free 47-Point CRO Audit</h1>
        <p class="contact-header__subtitle">
          Tell us about your site and goals. We'll review your funnel, identify your biggest revenue leaks,
          and share a prioritised action plan — completely free, no strings attached, response within 24 hours.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-content container">
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <!-- Form -->
        <div class="contact-form-wrap">
          <form
            id="contact-form"
            class="contact-form"
            method="POST"
            aria-label="Contact form"
          >
            <!-- FormSubmit config -->
            <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New CRO Audit Request — grow-conversions.com" />
            <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://grow-conversions.com/thank-you/" />
            <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />
            <input type="text" name="_honey" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" />

            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label" for="name">Your Name *</label>
                <input
                  class="form-input"
                  type="text"
                  id="name"
                  name="name"
                  placeholder="Jane Smith"
                  required
                  autocomplete="name"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label" for="email">Email Address *</label>
                <input
                  class="form-input"
                  type="email"
                  id="email"
                  name="email"
                  placeholder="jane@company.com"
                  required
                  autocomplete="email"
                />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label" for="website">Website URL *</label>
              <input
                class="form-input"
                type="text"
                id="website"
                name="website"
                placeholder="yourwebsite.com"
                required
                autocomplete="url"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label" for="traffic">Monthly Traffic (approx.)</label>
              <select class="form-select" id="traffic" name="traffic">
                <option value="">Select range</option>
                <option>Under 1,000 visitors</option>
                <option>1,000 – 10,000 visitors</option>
                <option>10,000 – 50,000 visitors</option>
                <option>50,000 – 200,000 visitors</option>
                <option>200,000+ visitors</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label" for="message">What's your biggest conversion challenge?</label>
              <textarea
                class="form-textarea"
                id="message"
                name="message"
                placeholder="e.g. Our checkout abandonment rate is 78% and we don't know why. We're spending $20K/mo on ads but CVR hasn't moved in 6 months..."
                rows="5"
                style="overflow-y: hidden;"
              ></textarea>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg contact-form__submit">
              Request My Free Audit →
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
              </svg>
            </button>

            <p class="contact-form__privacy">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"/>
              </svg>
              Your information is private. We never share or sell your data.
            </p>
          </form>
        </div>

        <!-- Info sidebar -->
        <aside class="contact-info" aria-label="What to expect">
          <h2 class="contact-info__title">What Happens Next</h2>
          <ol class="contact-steps">
            {[
              { title: 'We review your site', desc: 'Within 24 hours we do a quick review of your site and analytics before the call.' },
              { title: 'You get a calendar invite', desc: 'We\'ll send a Calendly link to pick a time for a 30-minute strategy call.' },
              { title: 'Free audit walkthrough', desc: 'On the call, we share our findings and the 3–5 biggest opportunities we see.' },
              { title: 'You decide what\'s next', desc: 'No pressure. If we\'re a fit, we\'ll discuss engagement options. If not, the audit is yours to keep.' },
            ].map(({ title, desc }, i) => (
              <li class="contact-step">
                <div class="contact-step__number" aria-hidden="true">{i + 1}</div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="contact-step__title">{title}</h3>
                  <p class="contact-step__desc">{desc}</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ol>

          <div class="contact-guarantee">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-success)" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <p class="contact-guarantee__title">100% Free. Zero Obligation.</p>
              <p class="contact-guarantee__text">We offer free audits because they work. Our close rate from free audits is high because we genuinely find valuable problems. You get real value regardless of what you decide.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
    <section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
      <div class="container" style="max-width: 760px;">
        <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:left;">Common Questions</h2>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-8);">
          <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Is the audit really free?</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-text);">Yes. We review your site, run analytics analysis, and walk you through our findings on a 30-minute call at no cost. We offer free audits because they consistently lead to paid engagements — but that outcome is entirely your choice. The audit is yours regardless.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">What kind of businesses do you work with?</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-text);">We work with e-commerce stores, SaaS products, and B2B services companies. The common factor is a clear conversion goal and at least 1,000 monthly visitors. We work with businesses at all stages — from early-stage startups optimising their first funnel to established companies running systematic A/B testing programmes.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">How long does a full engagement take?</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-text);">The audit itself is delivered within 5–7 business days of our initial call. Full CRO engagements typically run 3–6 months, with the first measurable results appearing within 30–60 days. A/B testing programmes are ongoing by nature — the longer you run them, the more compounding gains accumulate.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">What do you need from us to get started?</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-text);">Just your website URL and access to your Google Analytics (view-only is fine). We handle the rest. You don't need to prepare anything for the first call — we'll have already done a preliminary review of your site before we speak.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  // Set form action via JS to prevent Cloudflare email obfuscation
  const form = document.getElementById('contact-form') as HTMLFormElement;
  if (form) {
    const u = 'mariokurenn' + String.fromCharCode(64) + 'gmail.com';
    form.setAttribute('action', 'https://formsubmit.co/' + u);
  }

  const textarea = document.getElementById('message') as HTMLTextAreaElement;
  if (textarea) {
    const autoResize = () => {
      textarea.style.height = 'auto';
      textarea.style.height = textarea.scrollHeight + 'px';
    };
    textarea.addEventListener('input', autoResize);
  }
</script>

